<title>USA: Bay Medical Center, Mich., bonds restructured.</title>
<headline>Bay Medical Center, Mich., bonds restructured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc said Wednesday it restructured Michigan State Hospital Finance Authority's $28.4 million bond deal, for Bay Medical Center, adjusting coupons in several maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>MICHIGAN STATE HOSPITAL FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $28,350,000*</p>
<p>HOSPITAL REVENUE AND REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>(BAY MEDICAL CENTER)</p>
<p>SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>		 A3 UNDERLYING	    A- UNDERLYING</p>
<p>FSA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 02/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>07/01/2001		1,775M    4.40  %	  4.50</p>
<p>07/01/2002		1,865M    5.00  %	  4.60</p>
<p>07/01/2003		1,955M    4.60  %	  4.70</p>
<p>07/01/2004		2,045M    4.70  %	  4.80</p>
<p>07/01/2005		2,155M    5.375 %	  4.90</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>07/01/2006		2,250M    5.375 %	  5.00</p>
<p>07/01/2007		2,380M    5.75  %	  5.10</p>
<p>07/01/2008		2,505M    5.10  %	  5.20</p>
<p>07/01/2009		2,625M    5.125 %	  5.30</p>
<p>07/01/2010		2,775M    5.25  %	  5.40</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>07/01/2011		2,930M    5.375 %	  5.50</p>
<p>07/01/2012		3,090M    5.375 %	  5.55</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 07/01/2007    101.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 07/01/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected on Thursday, February 13, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on February 26, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
